  "description": "\"Abandoned by his debt-ridden parents, Jasung survives each day while fleeing relentless loan sharks. \n\nThe only person who ever offered him a home was Choi Soogyum, a respected pillar of the Jaechun Syndicate whose loyalty, leadership, and charisma earned Jasung's unwavering admiration. \n\nBut as conflict with the rival il-geum Syndicate intensifies, Soogyum's growing absences spark rumors of betrayal. \n\nDetermined to prove his Boss's innocence, Jasung goes to confront him, only to discover Soogyum in a passionate encounter with Hwang Gae of the rival syndicate. \n\nIn a single moment, everything Jasung believed shatters. Betrayal soon gives way to an unfamiliar desire, awakening emotions he never knew existed and opening a Pandora's box that can never be closed.\" \n\n(Source: Lezhin US)\n\n*Note: Part of Peanutoon's Hardcore BL Danpyeonseon (하드코어 BL 단편선) Collection.*",
